      "claim": "Direct human absolute oral bioavailability records for nucleoside analogs exceed the 20% threshold: zalcitabine 80% (range 54-127%) in fasted patients (C10), ddA/ddl 38±15% in fasting patients (C07), and OGT719 about 25% in patients (C05).",
