      "claim": "Additional nucleoside/nucleobase analog F values are above 20%: zalcitabine 30% in fasted mice (C21), ddI 30-54% (C26), compound 109 30% in mice (C24), and compound 19 63% in rats and 71% in dogs (C18, C20).",
      "card_ids": ["C21", "C26", "C24", "C18", "C20"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 oral exposure records for lamivudine, famciclovir/penciclovir, and adefovir show measurable oral Cmax/AUC in humans, consistent with oral absorption of polar nucleosides.",
      "card_ids": ["C30", "C32", "C38", "C33", "C36", "C29"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L4 records show high solubility for polar nucleoside analogs (ribavirin C41/C43/C50, ganciclovir C40, aciclovir dissolution C49, guanosine C44/C51, trifluridine C48) and net absorptive jejunal flux for lamivudine (C42 vs C46).",
      "card_ids": ["C41", "C43", "C50", "C40", "C49", "C44", "C51", "C48", "C42", "C46"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L5 records show nucleoside transporter-mediated uptake for NHC and cladribine (C56, C58, C62) but also BCRP efflux for cladribine (C52, C54, C55, C57, C59, C60, C61, C63) and low Caco-2 Papp for EFdA (C53); these are analog, mechanism-only observations and do not establish F<20% for the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C56", "C58", "C62", "C52", "C54", "C55", "C57", "C59", "C60", "C61", "C63", "C53"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L6 hepatic-clearance records show low intrinsic clearance for theophylline (C64, C65) and zidovudine (C68, C69, C73, C75) and moderate predicted hepatic clearance for 6-deoxypenciclovir (C70, C74); C66's high AO clearance is prodrug-specific and not transferable to the guanine query, so no query-specific high first-pass evidence is present.",
      "card_ids": ["C64", "C65", "C68", "C69", "C73", "C75", "C70", "C74", "C66"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "No transferable record affirmatively supports F<20%; cefepime low F (C14, C23) is from a cephalosporin context with low relevance to a guanine nucleoside.",
      "card_ids": ["C14", "C23"]
    }
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
    {
      "family": "hepatic_clearance_metabolic_stability",
      "applicability": "moderate",
      "direction": "supportive",
      "decision_effect": "strengthened",
      "card_ids": ["C64", "C65", "C66", "C67", "C68", "C69", "C70", "C71", "C72", "C73", "C74", "C75"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the exact query molecule.",
